[32m+[m[32m    Test-NetConnection 192.168.1.13 -Port 8001[m
[32m+[m[32m    Invoke-WebRequest http://192.168.1.13:8001/api/device/prn-auto-print/public/keys/ -UseBasicParsing[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mExpected: `TcpTestSucceeded : True` and HTTP 200 with `{"keys":[{"key_id":...,"algorithm":"Ed25519"}]}`.[m
